{"id": "EUVD-2026-80628", "enisaUuid": "08169e68-130f-3e10-9c9f-485976f52f0c", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nUSB: gadget: fix NULL pointer dereference in gadget_dev_ioctl()\n\ngadget_dev_ioctl() reads dev->gadget before acquiring dev->lock, but\ndev->state is checked after acquiring the lock. Therefore a concurrent\nbind can change the device state between these operations, which can\nleave ioctl with a stale NULL gadget pointer and causing a NULL pointer\ndereference at gadget->ops->ioctl.\n\nRead dev->gadget while holding dev->lock so that the gadget pointer\nand device state are sampled consistently.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:33:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:56:33", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8be30959be31b4205e3bdd2e2a6221f3a2ee7ea1", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e8219accce2f6d3502ed71f5b5e854ecf27249a6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/87cbf9410b12f5c2d659bb01e8ecf6517cb9f28c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/162178ca83c3de986900385a0477eb539f8e1a7e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ebd916fdfefaacbc0e577f7037ec96b31a105e5f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c29a83c1ff3f06d5751f6d365b606c9f81ccc4cb", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/64ec019bf9a8b12f53b9f2777d65aadb730b5a84", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dd0eed9e165b1a6292f49e622e3dd0b7d99b106d"], "aliases": ["GHSA-gf8h-9qpm-2gf3", "CVE-2026-90020"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0459ebe8-ddfe-3e61-9be5-7be2815bd21d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.15.221"}, {"id": "0fa7c278-f101-3892-acb4-ce14f2caaddb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <e8219accce2f6d3502ed71f5b5e854ecf27249a6"}, {"id": "1385c550-550b-3634-8617-a737601296b2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <ebd916fdfefaacbc0e577f7037ec96b31a105e5f"}, {"id": "1f8f1c51-885e-360b-90e3-479c63b8e819", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <87cbf9410b12f5c2d659bb01e8ecf6517cb9f28c"}, {"id": "21f7a5bf-33ea-376f-9e28-78aee653f0e1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.51"}, {"id": "33d1dc06-415d-3e56-8282-51b5d34d2439", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "430a7e25-9068-3256-ab52-83fd37463863", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.110"}, {"id": "43bddd55-201e-30f8-9b88-3fde9dfe28ff", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.5"}, {"id": "4f283d06-860d-387b-9f89-e52cce19a652", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <162178ca83c3de986900385a0477eb539f8e1a7e"}, {"id": "53b51d4b-a8d0-377c-a2a4-4aff08214089", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.188"}, {"id": "6036191a-2802-3a31-bcf1-b78a92afdf62", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "718e8261-9fad-307c-bc35-3f459b67b3c9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.157"}, {"id": "891a1a95-f6f0-37d7-ad95-02c4238b2532", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.10.270"}, {"id": "a7cd1ab8-4539-3aef-b24a-33bcbc0c2000", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2.6.12"}, {"id": "b14acecf-6c88-350b-b0eb-e8217fa00f9d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <8be30959be31b4205e3bdd2e2a6221f3a2ee7ea1"}, {"id": "b91f5f19-4f